<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Avon Crowncaps profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Avon Crowncaps profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month results for Nigerian packaging company Avon Crowncaps to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>						(In million naira)</p>
<p>						   1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover					1,500  vs  1,200</p>
<p>Profit before taxation		    126.3  vs  100.7</p>
<p>Taxation					 22.0  vs   30.2</p>
<p>Profit after taxation			104.3 vs   70.5</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
